sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Frontend Admin
    participant Auth as auth-service
    participant AdminService as admin-service
    participant LangGraph as Orchestration / LangGraph
    participant Security as security-service
    participant Retrieval as retrieval-service
    participant Generation as generation-service
    participant Preprocessing as preprocessing-service
    participant Tooling as Outils / services backend

    Admin->>Frontend: Envoyer une demande admin
    Frontend->>Auth: Verifier la session admin
    Auth-->>Frontend: Session valide
    Frontend->>AdminService: Transmettre la demande
    AdminService->>LangGraph: Initialiser l'orchestration

    LangGraph->>LangGraph: Classifier l'intention
    Note over LangGraph: Intentions possibles :\n- conseil / information\n- inspection\n- mutation\n- workflow multi-etapes\n- ajustement RAG

    alt Demande simple
        LangGraph->>LangGraph: Selectionner une branche simple

        alt Conseil / information
            LangGraph->>Retrieval: Recuperer les sources utiles
            Retrieval-->>LangGraph: Chunks et metadonnees
            LangGraph->>Generation: Generer une reponse contextualisee
            Generation-->>LangGraph: Reponse et synthese
        else Inspection
            LangGraph->>Tooling: Interroger l'etat du systeme
            Tooling-->>LangGraph: Informations d'inspection
        else Ajustement RAG
            LangGraph->>Security: Verifier l'autorisation
            Security-->>LangGraph: Autorisation accordee
            alt Reglage de chunking
                LangGraph->>Preprocessing: Mettre a jour la strategie
                Preprocessing-->>LangGraph: Configuration appliquee
            else Reglage de reranking / retrieval
                LangGraph->>Retrieval: Mettre a jour le reranking
                Retrieval-->>LangGraph: Configuration appliquee
            end
        else Mutation
            LangGraph->>Security: Verifier l'autorisation
            Security-->>LangGraph: Autorisation accordee
            LangGraph->>Tooling: Executer l'action de mutation
            Tooling-->>LangGraph: Resultat de la mutation
        end

    else Demande complexe
        LangGraph->>LangGraph: Detecter un scenario multi-task / multi-etapes
        Note over LangGraph: Decomposition en plusieurs taches\ncoordonnees par l'agent

        LangGraph->>Security: Verifier les operations sensibles
        Security-->>LangGraph: Autorisations / restrictions

        LangGraph->>Tooling: Executer tache 1
        Tooling-->>LangGraph: Resultat tache 1

        opt Recuperation de contexte supplementaire
            LangGraph->>Retrieval: Recuperer des passages ou etats utiles
            Retrieval-->>LangGraph: Contexte additionnel
        end

        LangGraph->>Tooling: Executer tache 2
        Tooling-->>LangGraph: Resultat tache 2

        opt Ajustement de configuration pendant le workflow
            LangGraph->>Preprocessing: Appliquer un reglage de chunking
            Preprocessing-->>LangGraph: Reglage confirme
            LangGraph->>Retrieval: Appliquer un reglage de reranking
            Retrieval-->>LangGraph: Reglage confirme
        end

        opt Synthese guidee par le LLM
            LangGraph->>Generation: Produire une synthese finale
            Generation-->>LangGraph: Synthese structuree
        end
    end

    LangGraph-->>AdminService: Retourner la decision finale
    AdminService-->>Frontend: Reponse admin structuree
    Frontend-->>Admin: Afficher la reponse finale
